# Press camera (R10): the player's tool, worn on the chest and raised to shoot. Ink body, paper top plate,
# steel lens barrel along +x, signal-yellow flash (a thing the player uses), steel strap lugs.
# Regridded to 5 cm voxels (R1 floor, CP7).
name presscam
grid 5
size 7 5 5
slot body Ink
slot top Paper
slot lens Steel
slot flash Signal
box 0 0 0 4 5 4 body
box 0 0 3 4 5 4 top
beam 4 2 2 6 2 2 1 lens
carve beam 6 2 2 6 2 2 1
box 1 0 3 4 3 5 flash
box 1 0 2 2 1 3 lens
box 1 4 2 2 5 3 lens
pivot 2 2 0
